  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Surface",
      "items": [
        "POST /chat/messages — one turn: intent, reply, trace, citations, directives",
        "POST /chat/actions/{action_id} — the approve that performs a proposed write",
        "GET /chat/conversations and /chat/conversations/{id} — the actor's own threads only",
        "Code adds POST /chat/messages/stream (SSE) and /chat/pipeline; the lock file still says no streaming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Inside",
      "items": [
        "Two DSPy steps, never one: the router picks tools, the responder only writes prose",
        "RAG over a Vietnamese corpus shipped inside the package, because .dockerignore drops docs/",
        "Hybrid retrieval with an unconditional lexical floor — the dense leg may be down and it still answers",
        "The rate limiter is in-process, which is correct only while ADR-0033 runs one app container"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Guarantees",
      "items": [
        "Submit, approve, release, break-glass and withdraw have no tool, at any confidence",
        "The catalogue holds no send/post/email/fetch; research_topic is one pinned, allow-listed exception",
        "Seven UI directive kinds, derived in code; navigate is matched against an anchored route allow-list",
        "prope_app has no DELETE on any chat table; another actor's thread or proposal is not_found"
      ]
    }
  ]
}